# Keep the build context small + reproducible (install happens inside the image from the lockfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example
# The API image has no use for the frontend — dropping it keeps the context small. The WEB image
# builds from this same context root, so it carries its own `apps/web/Dockerfile.dockerignore`
# (which BuildKit prefers) to undo this exclusion for itself.
apps/web
docs
*.md
